WEBVTT

00:00:29.446 --> 00:00:32.699
So... that's Suimitsutou...

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:38.204
Our plan was for me to come out
and fight if our the operation went sour.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:48.423
Akari Mamiya! Aria Kanzaki!

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:49.382
"Potato Chips"

00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:57.932
I'm not gentle like Kyochikutou!

00:02:36.197 --> 00:02:38.116
Don't get in my way!

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:53.548
Now, release my precious
little sister and return her to me!

00:02:53.548 --> 00:02:58.928
If you don't, who knows how
many people will have to die?

00:02:58.928 --> 00:03:03.558
Kyochikutou! As promised,
your kind sister has come to rescue you!

00:03:03.558 --> 00:03:06.811
Are you watching this?! Am I cool or what?!

00:03:08.563 --> 00:03:13.902
You're embarrassing me, Sis.
I wish you had stayed on standby forever.

00:03:16.071 --> 00:03:18.823
I never imagined that such a
monster was waiting in the wings...

00:03:18.823 --> 00:03:21.576
To think that I can only watch from here...

00:03:21.576 --> 00:03:24.037
Hey, don't you have more medicine?

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:28.333
Don't be hasty. You should recover soon.

00:03:28.333 --> 00:03:30.251
Please be patient.

00:03:41.262 --> 00:03:44.099
Kyochikutou and Suimitsutou...

00:03:44.099 --> 00:03:48.103
I like peach buns,
but those two aren't acceptable.

00:03:48.103 --> 00:03:50.105
Suimitsutou...

00:03:50.105 --> 00:03:53.483
I heard that the armored machine
she's operating is a special one

00:03:53.483 --> 00:03:55.610
that was developed for combat by I-U.

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:05.578
Suimitsutou infiltrated in order to
back up Kyochikutou as well as to test it.

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:08.832
She's probably planning to keep
running amok until she gets her sister back.

00:04:08.832 --> 00:04:10.834
Miss Mamiya! Are you okay?!

00:04:10.834 --> 00:04:12.168
Kirin!

00:04:18.842 --> 00:04:23.430
Where are you? I'll come to rescue you!

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:25.306
It'll be hard to meet up.

00:04:25.306 --> 00:04:28.560
We're okay, so you hurry up and escape!

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:29.811
But...

00:04:29.811 --> 00:04:33.523
Kirin! Take Shino to a doctor right away!

00:04:35.191 --> 00:04:38.653
Okay. Please be careful.

00:04:43.199 --> 00:04:45.660
Kyochikutou! Are you watching this?!

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:47.829
It was like this two years ago.

00:04:47.829 --> 00:04:48.830
What?

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:52.625
The place where we lived was attacked.

00:04:52.625 --> 00:04:55.170
Many people were injured.

00:04:59.341 --> 00:05:01.176
I have to do something!

00:05:01.176 --> 00:05:02.010
Akari!

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:03.595
Yay! Yay!

00:05:13.521 --> 00:05:15.815
"Potato Chips"

00:05:15.815 --> 00:05:22.781
My, my... You weren't dead yet?
You sure are persistent.

00:05:34.876 --> 00:05:36.419
I'm sorry.

00:05:36.419 --> 00:05:39.381
Close-quarters combat is dangerous.
Do you have a gun?

00:05:39.381 --> 00:05:40.924
Yes!

00:05:51.101 --> 00:05:54.771
What's the matter? Are you done already?

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:00.151
Looks like it can work.

00:06:00.151 --> 00:06:00.777
What?

00:06:00.777 --> 00:06:04.364
Akari, do as I tell you.

00:06:04.364 --> 00:06:06.700
Okay. Whatever you say!

00:06:11.079 --> 00:06:13.832
What? We're going to use <i>that</i>?

00:06:13.832 --> 00:06:18.336
That's right. I'll be the decoy
and get her attention,

00:06:18.336 --> 00:06:21.756
so use that chance to go meet up
with Reki and the others.

00:06:21.756 --> 00:06:23.758
I've already told Reki about the plan.

00:06:23.758 --> 00:06:25.468
It's too dangerous!

00:06:25.468 --> 00:06:29.097
If you escape in the smoke,
you can buy some time.

00:06:29.097 --> 00:06:34.269
Don't worry. I won't be defeated so easily.

00:06:34.269 --> 00:06:35.478
Then...

00:06:38.523 --> 00:06:40.525
...I'll be the decoy!

00:06:40.525 --> 00:06:41.943
What?!

00:06:41.943 --> 00:06:43.820
What're you saying?! You can't possibly do it!

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:49.701
You told me not to say
"I can't do it," didn't you?

00:06:49.701 --> 00:06:51.703
But this is different...

00:06:52.829 --> 00:06:56.583
Besides, you're the only one who can use <i>that</i>.

00:06:56.583 --> 00:07:00.670
This division of roles, in which
I become the decoy, is the correct one!

00:07:02.589 --> 00:07:03.673
I'm going!

00:07:03.673 --> 00:07:05.175
Akari!

00:07:13.224 --> 00:07:16.644
While one becomes a decoy,
the other will make a move, huh?

00:07:16.644 --> 00:07:18.688
How predictable they are.

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:27.072
But if I bring them down even
before that, their plan will go in vain.

00:07:31.576 --> 00:07:33.912
What a pitiful attack.

00:07:41.503 --> 00:07:43.004
Akari is what?!

00:07:44.798 --> 00:07:49.511
She's getting Suimitsutou's
attention by herself. Can you help us?

00:07:49.511 --> 00:07:50.512
Yes!

00:07:50.512 --> 00:07:52.681
The effect of the poison is wearing off, too.

00:07:52.681 --> 00:07:55.642
What do you want us to do?

00:07:55.642 --> 00:07:57.811
Back up Akari and me.

00:07:57.811 --> 00:07:59.688
Reki.

00:07:59.688 --> 00:08:02.857
We want you to use these guns and bullets.

00:08:02.857 --> 00:08:04.567
What's this?

00:08:04.567 --> 00:08:08.196
I... I'm coming, too.

00:08:08.196 --> 00:08:09.447
Shino!

00:08:09.447 --> 00:08:12.617
I tried to stop her, but she wouldn't listen.

00:08:12.617 --> 00:08:17.455
Akari is in a fix. I can't
just sit back and do nothing!

00:08:21.292 --> 00:08:24.504
Okay. I'll explain the plan.

00:08:30.051 --> 00:08:33.930
Tsk! When the target is small,
it's hard to hit it.

00:08:35.932 --> 00:08:38.476
Humph! I ran out of bullets.

00:08:49.738 --> 00:08:52.449
All right! Die!

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:59.664
Oh, that was clever.

00:09:01.666 --> 00:09:04.044
She stopped! Now!

00:09:07.213 --> 00:09:08.506
A smoke screen?!

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:14.137
It's our turn!

00:09:14.137 --> 00:09:16.014
Yes, Miss Urara!

00:09:21.269 --> 00:09:25.565
The monitor is...! They think they
contained my movement like this?!

00:09:31.071 --> 00:09:33.448
I'll deal with you first!

00:09:48.963 --> 00:09:51.299
Aria!

00:09:51.299 --> 00:09:53.134
That was perfect timing!

00:09:54.969 --> 00:09:59.099
Yes! You taught me to be punctual!

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:35.176
Stop it! Let go of me! Don't touch me!

00:10:35.176 --> 00:10:38.346
This is it. No more worries.

00:10:41.725 --> 00:10:44.853
You did a good job. A great feat!

00:10:46.187 --> 00:10:47.897
Aria...!

00:10:53.486 --> 00:10:58.950
We both got arrested, Sis...
Getting back into I-U seems impossible.

00:11:02.579 --> 00:11:04.205
I see...

00:11:04.205 --> 00:11:07.876
Got it. Thanks.

00:11:07.876 --> 00:11:10.337
Kyochikutou accepted a plea bargain

00:11:10.337 --> 00:11:13.798
and told them how to make
the antidote for Fuchou Poison.

00:11:13.798 --> 00:11:16.259
I think your sister will get better soon.

00:11:17.177 --> 00:11:19.179
Good...

00:11:19.179 --> 00:11:21.306
It's all thanks to you, Aria.

00:11:21.306 --> 00:11:22.891
Thank you very much!

00:11:26.811 --> 00:11:30.315
You'll be fine without me now.

00:11:31.691 --> 00:11:33.068
What?

00:11:36.363 --> 00:11:41.826
What do you mean by... without you?

00:11:41.826 --> 00:11:46.915
This was our first time and
last time working together on a case.

00:11:46.915 --> 00:11:51.127
If you want to become
someone's Amica, find someone else.

00:11:51.127 --> 00:11:54.589
Is it because I'm weak after all?

00:11:54.589 --> 00:11:57.592
Or is it because I was
keeping a secret from you?

00:11:57.592 --> 00:12:01.471
No, that's not it. I'm not concerned about that.

00:12:01.471 --> 00:12:06.184
I told you before that you
and I are too different.

00:12:08.103 --> 00:12:13.692
I fight alone, but you're the type
that works together with friends.

00:12:13.692 --> 00:12:16.861
Even if you stay with me, you won't learn much.

00:12:16.861 --> 00:12:18.279
B-But...!

00:12:18.279 --> 00:12:21.533
Isn't there a point in being together
precisely because we're differ--

00:12:21.533 --> 00:12:22.909
Besides...

00:12:24.994 --> 00:12:29.749
...as I told you the other day,
I have many enemies.

00:12:29.749 --> 00:12:34.129
If you're with me, it might put you in danger.

00:12:34.129 --> 00:12:38.133
Believe me. This is for your own good.
Find someone else to be an Amica for.

00:12:40.135 --> 00:12:43.430
Find someone who's more cooperative than me.

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:47.058
Someone who has a
high reputation and many friends.

00:12:50.061 --> 00:12:53.231
But... you're the only--

00:12:53.231 --> 00:12:55.316
--Akari!
--Akari!

00:12:55.316 --> 00:12:56.651
Miss Mamiya!

00:12:56.651 --> 00:12:57.819
Akari!

00:12:59.195 --> 00:13:01.573
Well then, I'll get going.

00:13:01.573 --> 00:13:04.034
I'd better hurry up and go back to the
hospital since I snuck out of there.

00:13:04.034 --> 00:13:05.994
Aria!

00:13:05.994 --> 00:13:07.871
The time I spent together with you...

00:13:09.831 --> 00:13:11.833
...was pretty fun.

00:13:13.418 --> 00:13:15.170
Goodbye, Akari.

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:17.380
Become a good <i>butei</i>.

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:19.674
Akari!

00:13:19.674 --> 00:13:21.009
Are you hurt?

00:13:21.009 --> 00:13:22.010
Miss Mamiya!

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:23.345
Akari!

00:13:28.933 --> 00:13:30.477
Aria!

00:13:30.477 --> 00:13:34.606
Please let me take your
Amica test one more time!

00:13:34.606 --> 00:13:39.110
Don't make me repeat it.
If you're with me, it'll put you in danger.

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:42.322
Then it won't be a problem if I'm strong...

00:13:42.322 --> 00:13:45.700
Strong enough to be able to help you, right?

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:49.746
I'll no longer try to forget
the Mamiya techniques.

00:13:51.414 --> 00:13:54.876
I'll use all my might and defeat you!

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:02.717
What you just said really ticked me off.

00:14:02.717 --> 00:14:08.890
You'll defeat me?
When you're D-ranked and I'm S-ranked?

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:10.266
Yes.

00:14:10.266 --> 00:14:13.728
If you lose, you'll give up this time for sure?

00:14:22.821 --> 00:14:27.909
It's the same test from before.
You'll win if you take this gun back.

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:34.249
But this time, I won't just run.
I'll come at you, too.

00:14:35.917 --> 00:14:37.585
I told you about this before.

00:14:37.585 --> 00:14:40.380
This is a hand-to-hand combat
technique passed down in my family.

00:14:52.976 --> 00:14:54.602
Strong...

00:14:54.602 --> 00:14:57.230
She really is strong!

00:14:57.230 --> 00:14:59.524
I guess that wasn't an empty boast.

00:15:01.276 --> 00:15:03.445
Tobiugachi won't be enough...

00:15:03.445 --> 00:15:07.157
Now that it's come to this,
I have no choice but use Takamakuri!

00:15:07.157 --> 00:15:08.575
But...

00:15:08.575 --> 00:15:11.578
Here's my seventh piece of advice for you.

00:15:11.578 --> 00:15:12.996
Once you face your opponent,

00:15:12.996 --> 00:15:15.623
there's no need to hold back
no matter who they are.

00:15:15.623 --> 00:15:17.709
It'd be rude if you didn't fight seriously.

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:21.171
Yes, ma'am!

00:15:21.171 --> 00:15:23.089
To tell you the truth...

00:15:26.092 --> 00:15:30.138
I thought this would happen someday.

00:15:30.138 --> 00:15:34.768
I knew you were the only one
who could drive me into a corner.

00:15:34.768 --> 00:15:36.853
And...

00:15:36.853 --> 00:15:40.690
...I'm the only one who can defeat you.

00:15:42.609 --> 00:15:44.277
Aria Kanzaki!

00:15:48.281 --> 00:15:50.492
I will defeat you!

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:19.229
If I disperse the vibrations,
I can avoid that attack.

00:16:19.229 --> 00:16:21.856
If there isn't anything
to disperse the vibrations,

00:16:21.856 --> 00:16:24.192
you shouldn't be able to use the same trick!

00:16:30.407 --> 00:16:31.783
I got it!

00:16:33.952 --> 00:16:35.412
I did it!

00:16:52.804 --> 00:16:56.975
That technique can be also canceled
out if the opponent spins with you.

00:16:56.975 --> 00:17:02.397
And you were defeated even though
you took the gun back. You're not thorough.

00:17:02.397 --> 00:17:06.026
Looks like you still have so much to learn.

00:17:06.026 --> 00:17:07.485
But, well...

00:17:10.739 --> 00:17:13.825
...I'll just say that you won.

00:17:17.579 --> 00:17:19.247
Ahh!

00:17:19.247 --> 00:17:23.126
Nonoka! Why didn't you wake me up?!

00:17:23.126 --> 00:17:25.253
I tried, Sis.

00:17:25.253 --> 00:17:27.922
But then you hit me.

00:17:27.922 --> 00:17:29.924
Ah... Sorry.

00:17:34.679 --> 00:17:36.431
"7. Once you face your opponent,
fight with all your might even if it's Aria."

00:17:36.431 --> 00:17:38.183
"Congrats!!"   "Amica Contract Established"

00:17:39.768 --> 00:17:41.770
How're you feeling?

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:47.192
I'm all good. And my doctor
said there's no need to worry.

00:17:47.192 --> 00:17:49.944
Well then, Nonoka. I'm heading out now.

00:17:49.944 --> 00:17:52.322
Watch out for cars!

00:17:54.449 --> 00:17:59.037
I saw that incident being reported
as a tank truck accident in the news.

00:17:59.037 --> 00:18:03.583
We were also told not
to tell anyone about the details.

00:18:03.583 --> 00:18:06.670
The situation seems somewhat complicated.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:11.800
Yeah. But I think it'll become clear someday.

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:14.052
Aria said so, too.

00:18:14.052 --> 00:18:18.306
Akari, no matter what happens,
we'll be there to help you.

00:18:18.306 --> 00:18:20.809
So come to us anytime. Don't hesitate.

00:18:20.809 --> 00:18:22.477
Thanks!

00:18:22.477 --> 00:18:27.065
Before that, please help me, Raika!

00:18:27.065 --> 00:18:28.525
Wh-What?!

00:18:28.525 --> 00:18:31.027
I want you to give us lessons again.

00:18:31.027 --> 00:18:33.530
--Let's go!
--Hey!

00:18:35.824 --> 00:18:38.201
She's very popular as always.

00:18:38.201 --> 00:18:41.913
Akari, if you like, let's go
have some Leaf Pies today.

00:18:41.913 --> 00:18:43.498
Hold it right there!

00:18:43.498 --> 00:18:44.457
Hm?

00:18:44.457 --> 00:18:47.252
Akari is going out for dinner with me.

00:18:47.252 --> 00:18:50.380
I've already arranged first-class food!

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:53.842
What's your problem, all of sudden?!
Akari's going to get Leaf Pies with me!

00:18:53.842 --> 00:18:55.927
Yuyu! Yaya! Do it!

00:18:55.927 --> 00:18:57.595
Yes, Miss Urara!

00:18:57.595 --> 00:19:00.890
Hey, let go of me! I'll use my sword on you!

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:03.685
Shino. Takachiho. Sorry!

00:19:03.685 --> 00:19:06.688
I have to go see Aria again today!

00:19:06.688 --> 00:19:07.647
What?!

00:19:07.647 --> 00:19:09.858
Well then, see you tomorrow!

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:14.988
In the end, this is always...

00:19:14.988 --> 00:19:17.949
...how it turns out for us, huh?

00:19:17.949 --> 00:19:20.368
Excuse me, Miss Urara...

00:19:20.368 --> 00:19:24.205
What should we do with the food we ordered?

00:19:24.205 --> 00:19:27.459
It'll be a waste if we don't eat it...

00:19:27.459 --> 00:19:29.377
Do you wanna join me?

00:19:29.377 --> 00:19:33.673
I guess... since I don't have any other plans.

00:19:36.885 --> 00:19:39.387
Would you like to work together on a plan

00:19:39.387 --> 00:19:43.391
to get Akari away from Aria?

00:19:43.391 --> 00:19:47.062
Sounds good. Let's discuss it thoroughly.

00:19:47.062 --> 00:19:50.482
Looks like more trouble is on its way...

00:19:50.482 --> 00:19:53.234
But that's so...

00:19:53.234 --> 00:19:55.653
"Ya" "Yu"
...wonderful!

00:19:57.197 --> 00:19:59.574
That was awesome, Aria!

00:19:59.574 --> 00:20:05.246
You crushed Kyochikutou and her sister,
as well as the bus hijackers.

00:20:05.246 --> 00:20:08.208
What kind of a person was the perpetrator?

00:20:08.208 --> 00:20:12.629
There was a plea bargain.
I can't talk about the perp.

00:20:12.629 --> 00:20:14.547
Tee-hee-hee.

00:20:14.547 --> 00:20:19.094
Is it possible that she told you
something about the perp, Riko?

00:20:19.094 --> 00:20:23.264
Not at all. Aria is cold to me.

00:20:25.433 --> 00:20:30.438
More importantly, I heard Suimitsutou
accepted the plea bargain, too.

00:20:30.438 --> 00:20:33.817
Ms. Takamagahara also complimented you.

00:20:33.817 --> 00:20:36.152
Oh, shucks.

00:20:36.152 --> 00:20:40.865
But for <i>butei</i>, bringing things to an end
with an enemy isn't the end of the story.

00:20:40.865 --> 00:20:45.829
Now that you're my official Amica,
keep your wits about you.

00:20:45.829 --> 00:20:47.288
Yes, ma'am!

00:20:52.002 --> 00:20:53.044
Hm?

00:20:53.044 --> 00:20:57.298
It's been a while. Are you
getting along with Shino okay?

00:20:57.298 --> 00:20:59.217
Yes, Hotogi!

00:21:00.969 --> 00:21:02.345
Kinji Tohyama...!

00:21:02.345 --> 00:21:03.638
Hm?

00:21:05.306 --> 00:21:06.933
Aria Kanzaki...!

00:21:06.933 --> 00:21:08.059
Hm?

00:21:08.059 --> 00:21:09.978
Are you guys going out together again?

00:21:09.978 --> 00:21:14.524
We're not just going out!
Aria and I are headed to work now!

00:21:14.524 --> 00:21:17.986
Some of the guys who were involved in
the crime the other day are still on the loose.

00:21:17.986 --> 00:21:20.822
We're going to help catch them.

00:21:20.822 --> 00:21:22.782
I see. Don't push too hard.

00:21:22.782 --> 00:21:26.453
We don't need you to worry about us!

00:21:26.453 --> 00:21:29.039
We'll be fine.

00:21:30.373 --> 00:21:31.833
Oh?

00:21:31.833 --> 00:21:33.835
Well then, see you around.

00:21:33.835 --> 00:21:36.504
Let's hurry up and go! Hurry!

00:21:38.840 --> 00:21:40.925
What's the matter, Kin?

00:21:40.925 --> 00:21:45.472
Well... I thought she seemed a bit different.

00:21:47.182 --> 00:21:52.687
All things are constantly changing
and new paths continue to open.

00:21:52.687 --> 00:21:54.189
That is how <i>butei </i>are.

00:21:57.525 --> 00:21:59.194
We'll go around from the back.

00:21:59.194 --> 00:22:00.320
Okay!

00:22:02.530 --> 00:22:04.032
What're you doing?!

00:22:04.032 --> 00:22:05.158
I'm sorry!

00:22:05.158 --> 00:22:05.658
"Episode 12: A Pair of As"

00:22:05.658 --> 00:22:08.745
"Episode 12: A Pair of As"
You're going back to being a trainee after all!

00:22:08.745 --> 00:23:41.227
"Episode 12: A Pair of As"
Whaaaaaat?!
